<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>About Me | Full Stack Developer</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Learn about Ankit Kumar, a Full Stack Developer using MERN Stack Technology & B.Tech CSE student at Parul University Vadodara.">

  <!-- CSS -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Navbar -->
  <%- include("include/navbar.ejs"); %>

  <section class="about-section" id="about">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-subtitle">About Me</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Full Stack Developer <span class="gradient-text-accent">Using MERN Stack</span></h2>
      <p class="section-desc">Computer Science & Engineering Student at Parul University, Vadodara, Gujarat (2023–2027).</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-hero-grid">
      <!-- Left Bio Card -->
      <div class="glass-card about-card tilt-card">
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">Professional Summary</h3>
        <div class="about-text">
          <p>
            I am a <strong>Full Stack Developer using MERN stack technology (MongoDB, Express.js, React.js, Node.js)</strong> and Computer Science Engineering student at Parul University, Vadodara, Gujarat (2023–2027).
          </p>
          <p>
            Proficient in building full-stack web applications, RESTful APIs, and backend systems. Strong foundation in <strong>Data Structures and Algorithms (70+ LeetCode problems solved)</strong>, DBMS, Operating Systems, and Computer Networks, with an interest in software development and AI applications.
          </p>
        </div>

        <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 18px 0 10px; color: var(--accent-primary);">
          <i class="fas fa-star" style="color: #f59e0b;"></i> Key Strengths & Technical Highlights:
        </h4>
        <ul style="padding-left: 20px; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.7; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
          <li><strong>MERN Stack Mastery:</strong> Building dynamic web portals with React.js frontend components, Express backend APIs, Node.js runtime, and MongoDB database architecture.</li>
          <li><strong>AI & Real-Time Tech:</strong> Integrated OpenAI API for automated interview analysis and implemented live video streaming using WebRTC and Socket.io.</li>
          <li><strong>API & Geolocation Integration:</strong> Integrated Google Maps API for location-based search and created REST APIs for government service platforms.</li>
          <li><strong>100+ LeetCode Solved:</strong> Solid foundation in Data Structures and Algorithms, Object-Oriented Programming, DBMS, OS, and Computer Networks.</li>
          <li><strong>Industry Certifications:</strong> Certified in Artificial Intelligence Fundamentals (IBM & Cisco), AWS Cloud Foundations, and Algorithm Design (CodeTantra).</li>
        </ul>

        <div style="margin-top: 24px; display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center;">
          <div class="liquid-badge">
            <i class="fas fa-layer-group"></i> Full Stack Developer
          </div>
          <div class="liquid-badge" style="background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.08); color: #06b6d4;">
            <i class="fab fa-react"></i> MERN Stack Technology
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 24px;">
          <button onclick="openResumeModal()" class="btn-liquid btn-liquid-primary">
            <i class="fas fa-file-pdf"></i> View & Download Resume
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Education Timeline & Milestones -->
      <div class="glass-card about-card">
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.35rem; margin-bottom: 20px;">Education & Academic Track</h3>
        
        <div class="timeline">
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <span class="timeline-date">2023 – 2027</span>
            <h4 class="timeline-title">Parul University, Vadodara, Gujarat</h4>
            <p style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-primary); font-size: 0.95rem;">B.Tech in Computer Science Engineering</p>
            <p class="timeline-desc"><strong>Coursework:</strong> Data Structures and Algorithms, Operating Systems, Computer Networks, Object-Oriented Programming, DBMS.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline-item">
            <span class="timeline-date">MERN Stack</span>
            <h4 class="timeline-title">GOV DESK & AI Hiring Platforms</h4>
            <p class="timeline-desc">Building RESTful APIs, React.js frontends, MongoDB databases, Express backend systems, and AI integrations (OpenAI, WebRTC, Socket.io).</p>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline-item">
            <span class="timeline-date">LeetCode</span>
            <h4 class="timeline-title">100+ DSA Problems Solved</h4>
            <p class="timeline-desc">Consistently practicing logic building, array manipulation, tree traversal, and algorithmic efficiency in Java.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Certifications Section -->
    <div class="section-header" style="margin-top: 60px;">
      <span class="section-subtitle">Verified Industry Credentials</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Certifications & <span class="gradient-text-accent">Training</span></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="services-grid">
      <div class="glass-card service-card tilt-card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
        <div>
          <div class="service-icon">
            <i class="fas fa-robot"></i>
          </div>
          <h3>Artificial Intelligence Fundamentals</h3>
          <p style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent-primary); font-size: 0.85rem;">IBM SkillsBuild & Cisco Networking Academy</p>
          <p>Covered machine learning fundamentals, neural networks, real-world AI applications, and ethical considerations in AI systems.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 18px; padding-top: 14px; border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-border-subtle);">
          <a href="https://skillsbuild.org" target="_blank" class="project-link-btn" style="font-size: 0.85rem; width: fit-content; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
            <i class="fas fa-certificate"></i> Verify / View Certificate <i class="fas fa-arrow-up-right-from-square" style="font-size: 0.75rem;"></i>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-card service-card tilt-card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
        <div>
          <div class="service-icon" style="background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1); color: #f59e0b;">
            <i class="fab fa-aws"></i>
          </div>
          <h3>AWS Academy Cloud Foundations</h3>
          <p style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent-primary); font-size: 0.85rem;">AWS Academy</p>
          <p>Foundational knowledge of cloud architecture, core AWS deployment models, cloud security basics, and virtualization.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 18px; padding-top: 14px; border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-border-subtle);">
          <a href="https://aws.amazon.com/training/aws-academy/" target="_blank" class="project-link-btn" style="font-size: 0.85rem; width: fit-content; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; color: #f59e0b;">
            <i class="fas fa-certificate"></i> Verify / View Certificate <i class="fas fa-arrow-up-right-from-square" style="font-size: 0.75rem;"></i>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-card service-card tilt-card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
        <div>
          <div class="service-icon" style="background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1); color: #10b981;">
            <i class="fas fa-project-diagram"></i>
          </div>
          <h3>Design & Analysis of Algorithms</h3>
          <p style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent-primary); font-size: 0.85rem;">CodeTantra & LeetCode 70+ Solved</p>
          <p>Algorithm design techniques, Big-O time and space complexity analysis, and structured problem-solving (70+ LeetCode problems solved).</p>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 18px; padding-top: 14px; border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-border-subtle);">
          <a href="https://leetcode.com" target="_blank" class="project-link-btn" style="font-size: 0.85rem; width: fit-content; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; color: #10b981;">
            <i class="fas fa-code"></i> View LeetCode Profile <i class="fas fa-arrow-up-right-from-square" style="font-size: 0.75rem;"></i>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact -->
  <%- include("include/contact.ejs"); %>

  <!-- Resume Modal -->
  <%- include("include/resume-modal.ejs"); %>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <%- include("include/footer.ejs"); %>

</body>
</html>